WEBVTT

1
00:00:15.381 --> 00:00:18.523
Morb howled, lunging toward the pieces of the broken jawbone.

2
00:00:18.543 --> 00:00:19.884
"Get him!"

3
00:00:20.404 --> 00:00:21.925
Vig shouted, raising his sword.

4
00:00:22.666 --> 00:00:26.028
A blast of energy shot out of it, but Morb dodged the blast.

5
00:00:26.849 --> 00:00:29.511
Morb snarled, looking around for somewhere to run.

6
00:00:29.791 --> 00:00:30.792
But he was surrounded.

7
00:00:31.552 --> 00:00:36.833
He rubbed his hands together, using his last bit of magic to levitate to a second-story balcony.

8
00:00:36.853 --> 00:00:38.994
"Stop him!"

9
00:00:39.274 --> 00:00:39.934
the king shouted.

10
00:00:39.954 --> 00:00:43.195
"Quick—get a Shield spell up around the palace!"

11
00:00:43.615 --> 00:00:44.395
another Red added.

12
00:00:47.336 --> 00:00:49.797
Perda, Darb, and Gliss sprinted over to Zann.

13
00:00:49.817 --> 00:00:51.978
"Wow, you were great!"

14
00:00:52.358 --> 00:00:53.138
Perda exclaimed.

15
00:00:53.918 --> 00:00:59.019
Zann stared at the balcony where Morb had disappeared, and then at the enormous glowing bubble that had

16
00:00:59.099 --> 00:01:00.740
just engulfed the entire palace.

17
00:01:01.832 --> 00:01:05.093
"Morb will never get through that shield," said Boz.

18
00:01:05.113 --> 00:01:10.674
"Morb has no intention of getting through the shield," said Zann, still looking at the balcony.

19
00:01:10.694 --> 00:01:13.355
"We need to go after him—now!"

20
00:01:14.215 --> 00:01:15.536
Zann rubbed his hands together.

21
00:01:15.556 --> 00:01:22.518
"Levitate!" As Zann rose into the air, Fala, Boz, Teplo, and all of his friends followed him.

22
00:01:23.578 --> 00:01:25.738
In a moment the whole group was on the balcony.

23
00:01:25.758 --> 00:01:28.559
"What do you think Morb is up to, Zann?"

24
00:01:28.879 --> 00:01:29.459
Boz asked.

25
00:01:29.479 --> 00:01:31.040
"Just come with me."

26
00:01:31.876 --> 00:01:34.577
Zann sprinted down the hall and burst into the storage room.

27
00:01:34.597 --> 00:01:36.718
"Stop!" he shouted.

28
00:01:37.459 --> 00:01:40.280
Morb was there, standing in front of the open wormhole.

29
00:01:41.280 --> 00:01:43.521
He glanced over his shoulder at Zann and the others.

30
00:01:44.242 --> 00:01:45.642
Boz rubbed his fingers together.

31
00:01:45.662 --> 00:01:52.185
"Freeze!' The spell flew directly at Morb, but before it hit him, it spun out of control and

32
00:01:52.245 --> 00:01:53.426
disappeared into the vortex.

33
00:01:54.326 --> 00:01:55.027
Morb laughed.

34
00:01:55.047 --> 00:01:58.500
"Immobilize!" said Fala.

35
00:01:58.520 --> 00:02:01.522
Her spell veered into the wormhole too, and Morb laughed again.

36
00:02:01.542 --> 00:02:04.805
"Where do you think you'll go, Morb?"

37
00:02:05.205 --> 00:02:05.746
said Boz.

38
00:02:05.766 --> 00:02:07.607
"You can't run forever."

39
00:02:08.427 --> 00:02:11.170
Morb glared at Boz for a moment and then looked at the others.

40
00:02:11.590 --> 00:02:13.091
His eyes rested on Zann.

41
00:02:13.111 --> 00:02:17.174
"I don't plan to run forever, Boz," warned Morb.

42
00:02:17.975 --> 00:02:20.536
"Magica hasn't seen the last of me!"

43
00:02:21.917 --> 00:02:25.380
With those words Morb stepped into the wormhole and disappeared.

44
00:02:30.652 --> 00:02:33.454
"I've never been so terrified in my entire life!"

45
00:02:33.934 --> 00:02:36.596
Gliss exclaimed, peeking through a heavy velvet curtain.

46
00:02:36.616 --> 00:02:38.678
"Really?" said Zann.

47
00:02:39.118 --> 00:02:42.380
"After everything we've been through, you're scared of a little crowd?"

48
00:02:42.400 --> 00:02:45.482
"A big crowd," Perda corrected.

49
00:02:45.502 --> 00:02:48.845
"I think at least half of Magica is out there!"

50
00:02:49.946 --> 00:02:54.749
It was a few days after Morb had disappeared, and Magica was slowly returning to normal.

51
00:02:55.530 --> 00:02:58.732
Zann and his friends were waiting in a small room beside the ballroom.

52
00:02:59.436 --> 00:03:03.618
They were about to be officially named "Heroes of Magica" by the king and queen.

53
00:03:04.338 --> 00:03:09.640
Darb was sitting on an overstuffed chair patting Zing, who wore a jaunty ribbon around his scaly neck.

54
00:03:10.320 --> 00:03:13.922
The little dragon was so excited that there were singe marks all over the room.

55
00:03:15.082 --> 00:03:17.923
Zann stepped over and repaired a burnt spot on Darb's shirt.

56
00:03:17.943 --> 00:03:20.444
"Thanks." Darb sounded distracted.

57
00:03:20.464 --> 00:03:22.205
"Are you okay?"

58
00:03:22.545 --> 00:03:23.086
Zann asked.

59
00:03:23.106 --> 00:03:24.386
"I guess."

60
00:03:24.806 --> 00:03:25.426
Darb shrugged.

61
00:03:25.446 --> 00:03:27.387
"Do you think Morb will ever come back?"

62
00:03:28.188 --> 00:03:28.968
Zann sighed.

63
00:03:29.460 --> 00:03:31.121
"It's better not to worry about it.

64
00:03:31.861 --> 00:03:34.902
If Morb does return, Magica will be ready for him."

65
00:03:35.882 --> 00:03:38.563
Just then they heard a shout of greeting from the doorway.

66
00:03:39.323 --> 00:03:42.104
Several of the kids' friends from Swamp Bottom rushed into the room.

67
00:03:42.124 --> 00:03:43.764
"You came!"

68
00:03:44.164 --> 00:03:46.445
Perda exclaimed, racing over to hug some of them.

69
00:03:46.465 --> 00:03:48.385
"Of course we came!"

70
00:03:48.765 --> 00:03:49.626
another kid exclaimed.

71
00:03:49.646 --> 00:03:53.227
"Everyone wants to see you guys get your reward!"

72
00:03:54.087 --> 00:03:55.007
Jev was there too.

73
00:03:55.327 --> 00:03:57.568
He walked over to Gliss, smiling sheepishly.

74
00:03:58.412 --> 00:03:59.712
"Hi, Gliss," he said.

75
00:03:59.732 --> 00:04:01.473
"I wanted to say I'm sorry.

76
00:04:02.173 --> 00:04:04.374
You know about what I said to you before."

77
00:04:04.394 --> 00:04:06.134
"It's okay, Jev."

78
00:04:06.514 --> 00:04:07.554
Gliss smiled back at him.

79
00:04:07.574 --> 00:04:09.555
"You did a lot to help us."

80
00:04:09.955 --> 00:04:10.815
Jev looked relieved.

81
00:04:10.835 --> 00:04:13.916
"Cool." He grinned and reached for Gliss' hand.

82
00:04:14.876 --> 00:04:16.077
But Darb got there first.

83
00:04:16.477 --> 00:04:18.918
He slid his hand into Gliss', and she squeezed it.

84
00:04:19.618 --> 00:04:23.359
"Yes, we really appreciate what you did to help us," Darb said.

85
00:04:24.159 --> 00:04:26.680
Jev's face went red as he realized what was happening.

86
00:04:26.700 --> 00:04:28.580
"Whatever," he muttered.

87
00:04:29.281 --> 00:04:29.921
Zann grinned.

88
00:04:30.222 --> 00:04:32.123
He couldn't blame Jev for being surprised.

89
00:04:32.803 --> 00:04:35.525
Zann hadn't noticed how close Gliss and Darb were getting either.

90
00:04:35.826 --> 00:04:36.766
But he was happy for them.

91
00:04:37.727 --> 00:04:39.568
He was still smiling when Perda rushed over.

92
00:04:39.588 --> 00:04:41.049
"Are you ready?"

93
00:04:41.390 --> 00:04:45.012
she asked breathlessly, looking prettier than ever in her formal gown.

94
00:04:45.032 --> 00:04:47.154
"It's time for us to go in!"

95
00:04:47.954 --> 00:04:55.540
Moments later Zann, Perda, Gliss, and Darb were marching up a long aisle, with Zing flying joyfully alongside.

96
00:04:56.300 --> 00:05:01.803
The enormous ballroom was filled with a cheering crowd, and even more people spilled into the courtyard.

97
00:05:02.543 --> 00:05:05.365
Colorful puffs of energy popped and sparkled overhead.

98
00:05:06.546 --> 00:05:09.387
The king and queen stood on a dais at the far end of the room.

99
00:05:10.067 --> 00:05:15.850
To their right stood the entire Red Council, and to their left were Boz, Teplo, and Fala.

100
00:05:16.511 --> 00:05:20.653
Zann felt self-conscious but proud as he walked up the long aisle with his friends.

101
00:05:21.473 --> 00:05:26.548
Still, looking at all the faces in the crowd, Zann couldn't help thinking that there were two very

102
00:05:26.588 --> 00:05:28.710
important people missing from the celebration.

103
00:05:29.610 --> 00:05:33.032
Were his parents still alive somewhere, trapped between worlds?

104
00:05:33.793 --> 00:05:37.375
What if Morb really was the sole person who knew where they were?

105
00:05:38.135 --> 00:05:41.377
Had Zann given up his one and only chance of finding them?

106
00:05:42.118 --> 00:05:43.238
He dismissed these thoughts.

107
00:05:44.039 --> 00:05:48.862
Morb's offer had tempted him, but Zann had made the only choice he could make— his parents would

108
00:05:48.982 --> 00:05:52.224
never have wanted him to sacrifice Magica just to save them.

109
00:05:53.328 --> 00:05:56.749
Reaching into his pocket, Zann touched the stone Wyssa had given him.

110
00:05:57.490 --> 00:06:01.111
His gaze wandered upward, toward the storage room with the wormhole.

111
00:06:01.771 --> 00:06:03.552
He didn't need Morb to find his parents.

112
00:06:04.332 --> 00:06:07.514
He just needed the courage to take a step into that vortex on his own.

113
00:06:08.234 --> 00:06:12.115
The wormhole was still up there—it would always be up there—waiting for him.
